{"4024750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INNOCENTS - The Lost Echoes", "steam_appid": 4024750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INNOCENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the darkest secrets of ANTHROPIA as Vixley, a fox detective haunted by visions, and her wolf enforcer, Grawl. To solve disturbing cases and expose a conspiracy buried at the Origin of their world, you must battle surreal horrors in a shifting mind maze and ruthless rebels on the streets. But in a city of liars and rebels, the most dangerous truth is that Vixley may not be able to trust the one person she relies on most: herself.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SWITCH PROTAGONIST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between two characters - a <strong>fox’s</strong> sharp investigation instincts and a <strong>wolf’s</strong> brutal combat prowess—to solve gruesome cases that demand both intellect and force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024750/extras/dbf157bcd854c1955db371a0696f3368.poster.avif?t=1759937390\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024750/extras/dbf157bcd854c1955db371a0696f3368.webm?t=1759937390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024750/extras/dbf157bcd854c1955db371a0696f3368.mp4?t=1759937390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVERSE REALITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the truth by shifting between the gritty <strong>reality</strong> and the surreal <strong>mindscape</strong> where every clue has a hidden meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024750/extras/88198bcd6f397c409b9fe13b04e838b2.poster.avif?t=1759937390\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024750/extras/88198bcd6f397c409b9fe13b04e838b2.webm?t=1759937390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024750/extras/88198bcd6f397c409b9fe13b04e838b2.mp4?t=1759937390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE ANTHROPIA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the sprawling towns and forgotten ruins of Anthropia, meeting a diverse cast of <strong>fellow Anthros</strong> to uncover their <strong>hidden</strong> <strong>stories</strong> and a <strong>forgotten</strong> <strong>past</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024750/extras/dc2a5ba1ce13aa54b89b25125fc00464.poster.avif?t=1759937390\" width=1170 height=732 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024750/extras/dc2a5ba1ce13aa54b89b25125fc00464.webm?t=1759937390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024750/extras/dc2a5ba1ce13aa54b89b25125fc00464.mp4?t=1759937390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE CASES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keen animal instincts to <strong>collect evidence and piece together clues</strong>, investigate mysteries that are far darker than they first appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024750/extras/f947bb3693a6a5748d34f800a74b39b9.poster.av